  <item>
    <title>广西美食雷达「桂林篇」Vol.41</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afd1d17fe62f8f52c4ce883</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afd1d17fe62f8f52c4ce883</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘟嘟嘟～一提到桂林，外地人想的是山水甲天下，但桂林人满脑子只有楼下那碗5块的粉，和街头巷尾的酸辣滋味。</span></p><p><span>这期《美食雷达》，我拉上两位桂林土著——JC和阿乐，抛开网红必吃榜，把从小吃到大的私藏清单全抖出来了，喜欢的话欢迎点个关注不迷路！</span></p><p><strong><span>⏱️ 时间轴</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a></span></strong><span> 正宗桂林米粉居然是？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a></span></strong><span> 桂林点粉黑话与防坑指南</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a></span></strong><span> 米粉红黑榜：</span><strong><span>又来</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>仁利</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>马家</span></strong><span>怎么选？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a></span></strong><span> 圆粉 vs 切粉之争，以及汤粉界的白月光</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a></span></strong><span> 铁西区老味道：高压锅酸辣</span><strong><span>螺蛳牛排</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a></span></strong><span> 必吃硬菜</span><strong><span>王城醋血鸭</span></strong><span>：记住只点半份鸭，必加五花肉、蒜苗！</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">28:51</a></span></strong><span> 地道正餐盘点：施家园</span><strong><span>荷塘土鸡</span></strong><span>、阳朔</span><strong><span>啤酒鱼</span></strong><span>选鱼诀窍、还有烫10秒就脆爽的</span><strong><span>斑鱼火锅</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">31:45</a></span></strong><span> 碳水炸弹</span><strong><span>糯米饭</span></strong><span>：九中回忆</span><strong><span>小红帽</span></strong><span>、包整块五花肉的</span><strong><span>糯香驿站</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a></span></strong><span> 学生时代回忆杀：</span><strong><span>椿记烧鹅</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>铭记烧腊</span></strong><span>（12块的酸辣手撕鸡永远的神）与太平路老店巡礼</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2649">44:09</a></span></strong><span> 夜宵与宝藏小馆：河池</span><strong><span>果酱烧烤</span></strong><span>（必点豆腐皮）</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2917">48:37</a></span></strong><span> 桂林十八酿代表之</span><strong><span>田螺酿</span></strong><span>，以及越喝越上头的</span><strong><span>恭城油茶</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3201">53:21</a></span></strong><span> 猎奇与下水天堂：王城马肉馆、专吃脆爽内脏的</span><strong><span>牛八宝</span></strong><span>火锅</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a></span></strong><span> 街头糖水铺：</span><strong><span>徐阿姨糖水</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>海大富</span></strong><span>、五毛钱一碗的古早清补凉</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3638">01:00:38</a></span></strong><span> 街头古早味：三轮车高压锅气嘴蒸出来的蘑菇状</span><strong><span>马蹄糕</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span>咱们下期见～！</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
