  <item>
    <title>越南美食地图「大叻下篇」Vol.36</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aafec620916f6f8b4465b02</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aafec620916f6f8b4465b02</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘟嘟嘟～大叻下篇来了。</span></p><p><span>这一期我们继续在大叻找吃的。上篇讲了很多鸡和猪肉，这一篇换到牛肉、法棍、小吃和海鲜。</span></p><p><span>大叻的牛肉很值得单独说。</span></p><p><span>咖喱牛肉可以配米饭，也可以用烤得酥脆的法棍蘸汤汁。</span></p><p><span>牛肉火锅更适合晚上吃，锅里有牛肉、牛尾、牛杂和泡面，蘸一点腐乳酱，吃完人都暖起来了。</span></p><p><span>法棍在这一期依然存在感很强。</span></p><p><span>它可以夹牛肉、鸡蛋、沙拉，也可以把盘子里的酱汁擦得干干净净。</span></p><p><span>我们还吃到一家去了七八次的早餐店，肉丸、鸡蛋、牛肉和酱汁都可以自己塞进法棍里。</span></p><p></p><p><span>后半段是大叻的小吃和夜宵。</span></p><p><span>早餐有鹌鹑蛋米饼，晚上有烤米纸，薄薄一张米纸烤到酥脆，上面铺鸡蛋、牛肉、火腿和奶酪，有点像越南街头版披萨。</span></p><p><span>海鲜部分也很意外。</span></p><p><span>海鲜粥煮得绵密，蒜香黄油生蚝的酱香到想拿去蘸法棍，最后还有一大盆香茅田螺酿。</span></p><p><span>大叻明明在山里，结果夜宵摊的海鲜也挺会给人惊喜。</span></p><p><span>【本期你将听到】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 牛肉咖喱、beef stew 和法棍蘸汤汁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> xiumai 79，法棍早餐为什么能去七八次</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 本地人牛肉火锅，腐乳酱配牛肉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 大叻早餐鹌鹑蛋米饼，鱼露酱和青芒果丝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 夜宵烤米纸，薄脆版越南披萨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> 海鲜粥，生蚝、花甲、扇贝和大虾都往里加</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a> 蒜香黄油生蚝，那碗酱才是灵魂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 香茅田螺酿，不爱吃螺的人也觉得好吃</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/658c39b7bf3589e894555307/luNKyBCNEV1BhSfUI7LzxRMt5053.m4a" length="34778149" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnuwgrh3kYLXK1xhE5ArjqPpzX3E.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>越南美食地图「大叻上篇」Vol.35</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa27bbc492687f6aad7dee6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa27bbc492687f6aad7dee6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 09:47:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>越南美食地图「大叻上篇」 Vol.35</span></p><p><span>嘟嘟嘟～这一期我们来到越南山城大叻。</span></p><p><span>在海拔一千五百米、七八月下雨也要穿外套的地方，最适合吃的就是热乎的鸡汤、刚烤好的鸡皮、鱼露炸鸡和一锅能把身体暖起来的酸笋鸡火锅。</span></p><p><span>我们在大叻待了将近一个月，骑着摩托看哪家本地人多就往哪儿钻。烤鸡吃了好几轮，酸笋鸡火锅去了好几次，路边夜宵也没少试。还有一家素食小店，用豆腐和蘑菇做出脆皮素鸡，直接骗过了我们八成味觉。</span></p><p><span>后半段也聊到猪肉。甜口烤五花配米饭，排队也值得。筒骨锅可以吸骨髓、烫一盆不知道名字的本地土菜。最后那家烤肉米纸卷，让我们吃到一半才想起来拍照。</span></p><p><span>【本期你将听到】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 大叻的鸡为什么好吃，山城里的鸡肉到底紧实在哪里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 烤鸡配糯米饭，鸡油渗进锅巴的那一口</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 吃了四五次的烤鸡店，甜咸鸡皮、花生碎和不辣但很香的辣椒</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnPiSpApmA_f-IqXMKgfJKv3VUSr.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 隐藏吃法，去大叻超市买 8000 越南盾法棍，自制鸡肉法棍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 公路边的咸口烤鸡，糯米饭更湿润，价格也更友好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 酸笋鸡火锅，十几度雨天里最暖的一锅</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fma3vJYPs84MvZSOV03tLKy1dUbB.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 路上偶遇的鸡肉粉，干拌鸡杂粉为什么让人想在鸡杂里挑粉吃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 夜宵摊的鱼露炸鸡，咸甜、发酵香和下饭程度都刚刚好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a> 生菜牛肉、猪脑煎蛋和虾酱空心菜，大叻夜宵的另一面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 快餐式鱼露炸鸡饭，一只巨大手枪腿解决一餐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> 素食馆里的脆皮素鸡，豆腐和蘑菇骗过八成味觉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a> 从鸡转到猪，越南烤猪肉饭里的五花肉和太阳蛋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a> 筒骨锅，吸骨髓、喝汤、烫一盆不知道名字的草药菜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">45:01</a> 大叻最好吃的一家烤肉米纸卷，肉串、香草、蒜片和蘸料一起卷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> 路边 9000 越南盾的椰子，以及青椰和老椰怎么选</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/658c39b7bf3589e894555307/lh3QCMGQI97vlLI0f8q38mMvefCX.m4a" length="47659607" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnuwgrh3kYLXK1xhE5ArjqPpzX3E.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>安徽美食地图「宣城篇」Vol.34</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697b60ea073030367a5cacd8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697b60ea073030367a5cacd8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 13:36:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘟嘟嘟～这一期我们聊一聊宣城有哪些好吃的店。从金黄酥脆的宁国粑粑到锅气十足的黄牛肉炒面，这座皖南小城的吃食真的值得专门跑一趟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>街头美食就是城市的呼吸。在宣城吃了一圈发现，最普通的食材也能做出花儿来——用赤豆酒酿解麻辣粉丝的油腻，把鸭肠鸭掌缠一起做"水阳三宝"，都挺有意思。</span></p><span></span><p><span>银桥湾夜市我们就一个办法：看哪家人多往哪钻。就这么瞎吃，吃到了现烤的云南小串，还有赤豆桂花小圆子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期你将听到】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 宁国粑粑：金黄酥脆，热乎乎的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWwytAetgwfLbowZxVlypp_Gfby.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 手擀面VS碱面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuolPCZN6FTLHMddD4Kae2XQJHNn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 卡旺卡黑全套：黑糖布丁加爆珠</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgimdUAMvXyEjQ1-MqRmVil9ijhi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 一块钱烧烤：云南小串五花肉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjJEVsXJJCu6OmU9qYTa4aqapn0y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a> 魏氏馄饨：做了几十年的老店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpC0i7vbBZxT4XwuH3Ih8XsfXi9h.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a> 水阳三宝：鸭货拼盘</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmAUZ5Yoo9yFhvqNU1DDtxFOV_dz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> 宛陵湖</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 欢迎订阅和分享「美食雷达」哦！</span><br><span>🤝 如果你也想推荐家乡美食可以添加微信备注“美食雷达听众投稿”，期待你的来信。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/658c39b7bf3589e894555307/ltxnpPOvAHFEs3mzjitN4NjuS91O.m4a" length="38653985" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUp4oqkPF72jiyfDPXb7SEN4_9I.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>韩国美食地图「济州岛篇」Vol.33</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695def5821cd486af75d1321</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695def5821cd486af75d1321</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Jan 2026 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘟嘟嘟～这一期我们来聊聊韩国美食地图之济州岛！这次所有餐厅也都是本地朋友带路～内含寻找餐厅的小技巧哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢的我们的播客的话，记得点个关注和心心❤️分享哦，现在关注的朋友都是尊贵的老粉～</span></p><span></span><p><span>想知道韩国首尔和釜山有什么好吃的？欢迎收听之前两期：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671b153644ae79002ce9fea7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671b153644ae79002ce9fea7"><span>韩国美食地图「首尔、釜山上篇」Vol.16</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6731749443dc3a438799a8a5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6731749443dc3a438799a8a5"><span>韩国美食地图「首尔、釜山下篇」Vol.17</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>传统韩餐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiAbNG56oo5N6gtPyRZ-wmculYra.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>银带鱼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqk35CRbwzhLCIYLP3es6EvkpeR3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>海边的咖啡馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBVMinK-5jmR8CAl0NQ9X3VRfiT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>传统市场里的米糕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkyfeFKx9e_vOEvPj5NcLtKeTHT4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>机场旁边的咖啡馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDkDOoAekKZuTJRJLKl84XqqibQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>鲍鱼粥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNfALiYHaV_KIPzOucXBvLNnvfr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>981Par</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnFeIDckwnnl27WG6eTWGJLh31_9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这一期的封面就是播客里提到的茶园啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>有什么好吃好玩的欢迎评论区分享（每一条我都会看的！），我们下一期见～</span></p>]]></description>
