  <item>
    <title>浙江美食地图「温州下篇」Vol.32</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69476d6e9f70e5d6b36cfdda</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69476d6e9f70e5d6b36cfdda</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘟嘟嘟～这次借着蹭饭的机会，与在温州生活多年的老友JC一同盘了盘当地的美食。</span></p><span></span><p><span>温州美食品种丰富，在横向对比时也有很多有趣的细节，由于可以聊的内容太多，只能分2篇展开说说。</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别适合去温州旅行前听听，说不定就能帮助你获得超出预期之上的体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接下来就和我们一起开启这趟旅程吧！喜欢的话欢迎大家点个关注和心心❤️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>糯米饭团炊饭：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>T0：水心芙蓉、洪殿良忠房产中介(洪殿豆腐脑店对面、雪莲松糕老店旁边)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqW2fp7Wn5CKjp9IuqP5gMkBadOB.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿兰、巷子口、娟娟、兰兰、杨家老饭团、九山老包、三姐妹、汉忠</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>敲鱼敲虾鱼圆：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>T0：东门敲虾、东门阿秋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv5SrL2cbsxobBvT7wULJnwDm1HV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgtX188Qp8gWjrMgB1oFKKD7eW89.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿红、陈辉、双莲桥、强能</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>杏仁腐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>狼叔叔、香柏树小吃、哈皮粑粑、噔噔哆、街边冷饮</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlEFxutBPWsGVmStI9J9zv148rUN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>豆浆椰汁打蛋：</span></p><span></span><p><span>糯米饭早餐店</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/658c39b7bf3589e894555307/lg03ZO73ReDOKme3Y8cTghNcaYM8.m4a" length="20028079" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkLSQBid0hKkp8lhixyMxQGKIiVQ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
