    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘟嘟嘟～这一期我们来聊一下格鲁吉亚的美食，包括格鲁吉亚的国菜，超好吃的奶油鸡，以及如何在路上解锁一次local的烤全羊体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢的话记得点个关注和心心哦！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>西格纳吉</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>偶遇的面包老店</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlFaYnGjGTxXxL0rlcsQI7asbedG.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Sighnaghi餐厅</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsCrCpxsHRDB86wCiL6YcFYerozL.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Burjj 奶油鸡（味道一绝</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjJA7_VjuYtOvTYlvPrOD8X1qCsr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>卡兹别克</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>登陆孤独星球封面的教堂</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhc-_X0hMHqM-nrqI6BvGXI-zcKQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在去乌兹别克路上的烤全羊</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2mpKWYhMZP3OMXLDQIeedzQGG3.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Juta线徒步（风景值得！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhMsczFg9W99aX9Hxew8SDiZH-qp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>第比利斯</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>格鲁吉亚的国菜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg3OOa_5pQqCfkt8ba_xolTidvCB.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Kutkhe</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr4ZIUHbFjI9AxfEIhNyH2J7YRmg.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>老城里的咖啡馆</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6D3HKp8ulg_YTA5ZYstLpwaS6M.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>城市里随处可见的红酒店铺</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FquKsgnf9xVWlXFOZlvAi9dHU-F_.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>二手古玩市场</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvu5l129m0UyAaqJlrOL0_RjYGvT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>感谢大家看到这里，欢迎大家关注「美食雷达」，更多图片也会放在🍠：</span><a href="我在小红书收获了2885次赞与收藏，来看看我的主页>> https://xhslink.com/m/2629PiwaQAu" data-url="我在小红书收获了2885次赞与收藏，来看看我的主页>> https://xhslink.com/m/2629PiwaQAu"><span>KK在远程</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>下期预告：埃及「达哈卜-亚历山大-开罗」，好吃好玩的都有哪些？</span></p>]]></description>
